          "label": "jmp *"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "duration_ms": 11000,
      "caption": "Initially the GOT slot points back into the stub, which falls into PLT0.",
      "narration": "Before the first call, the GOT slot holds the address of the stub's own next instruction. That pushes a relocation index and jumps to PLT0.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "First call falls through",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 6,
          "w": 84,
          "at": 0,
          "enter": "fade"
        },
        {
          "id": "stub",
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "asm",
          "text": "printf@plt:\n  jmp  *GOT[printf]\n  push $idx\n  jmp  PLT0",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 20.0,
          "w": 84,
          "at": 600,
          "enter": "slide-up"
        },
        {
          "id": "n",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "GOT[printf] starts at the push instruction.",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 47.6,
          "w": 84,
          "at": 1900,
          "enter": "fade",
          "color": "orange"
        },
        {
          "id": "hl-stub",
          "type": "highlight",
          "target": "stub",
          "at": 3600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "duration_ms": 11500,
      "caption": "PLT0 enters _dl_runtime_resolve, which looks up printf and overwrites the GOT slot.",
      "narration": "PLT0 pushes the link_map from GOT[1] and jumps to GOT[2], the dynamic linker's resolver. It finds printf in libc, writes its address into the slot, and jumps there.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "PLT0 and the resolver",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 6,
          "w": 84,
          "at": 0,
          "enter": "fade"
        },
        {
          "id": "p0",
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "asm",
          "text": "PLT0:\n  push GOT[1]   ; link_map\n  jmp  *GOT[2]  ; _dl_runtime_resolve",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 20.0,
          "w": 84,
          "at": 600,
          "enter": "slide-up"
        },
        {
          "id": "res",
          "type": "box",
          "text": "ld.so: find printf, patch GOT[printf]",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 43.7,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 14.2,
          "color": "green",
          "at": 1900,
          "enter": "pop"
        },
        {
          "id": "hl-p0",
          "type": "highlight",
          "target": "p0",
          "at": 3600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "duration_ms": 11000,
      "caption": "Later calls take PLT stub then jmp *GOT straight into libc: one extra indirect jump.",
      "narration": "From the second call on, the stub's first jump goes directly to printf in libc. Lazy binding costs only the first call and one indirect jump afterwards.",
      "elements": [
