    {
      "duration_ms": 10500,
      "caption": "-z now plus -z relro resolves eagerly and makes the GOT read-only.",
      "narration": "Lazy binding leaves a writable GOT, a classic exploit target. Linking with z now resolves everything at startup, and full RELRO then marks the GOT read-only.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "Hardening trade-off",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 6,
